      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Good evening, मैं Yogesh DHL Express India से बोल रहा हूँ। क्या मैं Mr Anthony Gressive से बात कर रहा हूँ?",
      "timestamp": "2026-07-23T12:37:49.964Z",
      "status": "final"
    },
    {
      "id": "customer_1784810280850_i65c",
      "role": "customer",
      "text": "Yes, speaking, if you can",
      "timestamp": "2026-07-23T12:38:00.851Z",
      "status": "final"
    },
    {
      "id": "assistant_1784810281221",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Thank you for confirming. I am calling about your pending DHL invoices. The reason for my call is that Mind Your Business Inc. has a total outstanding of INR 57,920 across 3 overdue invoices. May I know the reason for the delay so that I can note it correctly?",
      "timestamp": "2026-07-23T12:38:01.231Z",
      "status": "final"
    },
    {
      "id": "customer_1784810282896_4rw0",
      "role": "customer",
      "text": "Speak in English, that would be great.",
      "timestamp": "2026-07-23T12:38:02.897Z",
      "status": "final"
    },
    {
      "id": "assistant_1784810285884",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Absolutely, Mr Anthony. I’m calling because there’s a total outstanding of INR 57,920 on your DHL account across 3 overdue invoices. All past disputes were resolved and credit notes issued, but payment is still pending. Could you share what’s holding up the payment or if you need any help with the process?",
      "timestamp": "2026-07-23T12:38:05.885Z",
      "status": "final"
    },
    {
      "id": "customer_1784810310935_d2ix",
      "role": "customer",
      "text": "No, absolutely, that's fine. The payment has been released.",
      "timestamp": "2026-07-23T12:38:30.947Z",
      "status": "final"
    },
    {
      "id": "customer_1784810313080_0t40",
      "role": "customer",
      "text": "Today, so",
      "timestamp": "2026-07-23T12:38:33.081Z",
      "status": "final"
    },
    {
      "id": "assistant_1784810313315",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Thanks for letting me know, Mr Anthony. Could you please share the payment details or a quick screenshot on yogesh.jhamb@dhl.com, just so I can update your account and stop any further reminders?",
      "timestamp": "2026-07-23T12:38:33.315Z",
      "status": "final"
    },
    {
      "id": "assistant_1784810313447",
      "role": "assistant",
